<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>About Zoolirante Zoo</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
    <style>
        :root {
            --primary-color: #d2691e;
            --secondary-color: #FFA500;
            --background-color: #f8f4f0;
            --card-background: white;
            --text-color: #333;
            --sub-text-color: #666;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.7;
            color: var(--text-color);
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            background-color: var(--background-color);
        }

        .container {
            width: 90%;
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 30px 15px;
        }

        .page-title {
            color: var(--primary-color);
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 3.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        .page-subtitle {
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 1.3rem;
            color: var(--sub-text-color);
            margin-bottom: 40px;
            line-height: 1.8;
        }

        .section {
            background-color: var(--card-background);
            padding: 40px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            box-shadow: 0 8px 25px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
            margin-bottom: 40px;
            transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
        }

            .section:hover {
                transform: translateY(-5px);
                box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);
            }

        .section-heading {
            color: var(--secondary-color);
            font-size: 2.2rem;
            border-bottom: 4px solid var(--secondary-color);
            padding-bottom: 12px;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
            display: inline-block;
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        .emphasis {
            font-weight: bold;
            color: var(--primary-color);
            font-size: 1.1em;
        }

        .section-with-image {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
        }

        .image-content-container {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 40px;
            margin-top: 20px;
        }

            .image-content-container.reverse {
                flex-direction: row-reverse;
            }

            .image-content-container .text-content {
                flex: 1;
            }

        .section-image {
            width: 50%;
            border-radius: 10px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
            transition: transform 0.3s ease;
        }

            .section-image:hover {
                transform: scale(1.02);
            }

        

        .principles-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
            gap: 25px;
            list-style: none;
            padding: 0;
        }

            .principles-grid li {
                background-color: #fdfaf6;
                padding: 25px;
                border-radius: 10px;
                border-left: 7px solid var(--primary-color);
                transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
                display: flex;
                align-items: center;
                gap: 15px;
            }

                .principles-grid li:hover {
                    transform: translateY(-7px);
                    box-shadow: 0 10px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);
                }

            .principles-grid i {
                font-size: 1.8rem;
                color: var(--secondary-color);
                flex-shrink: 0;
            }

        
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="container">
        <h1 class="page-title">Discover Zoolirante Zoo</h1>
        <p class="page-subtitle">Join over 15,000 members in our community. Since 2010, we've been sharing the wonder of wildlife.</p>

        <article class="section">
            <h2 class="section-heading">Our Mission</h2>
            <p>At Zoolirante Zoo, our core purpose is to <span class="emphasis">connect people with nature</span> and <span class="emphasis">save species from extinction</span>.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="section section-with-image" id="city-zoo">
            <h2 class="section-heading">Zoolirante City Zoo</h2>
            <div class="image-content-container">
                <div class="text-content">
                    <p>Step off the busy city streets and into a world of wonder! In just minutes, you can experience the thrill of hand-feeding kangaroos, get up close with native koalas and wombats, hear the roar of an African lion, or feel the flutter of a colorful parrot's wings right above you. Welcome to Zoolirante City Zoo.</p>
                    <p>As an award-winning, not-for-profit conservation charity accredited by ZAA, our mission is to foster a deep connection between people and nature, actively working to save animals from extinction.</p>
                    <p>With over 1,800 animals calling Zoolirante City Zoo home, visitors become adventurers, exploring lush botanic gardens and encountering native and exotic animals in natural, stimulating environments. When it's time to leave, they carry new memories and a strengthened commitment to wildlife conservation.</p>
                </div>
                <img src="https://res.klook.com/images/fl_lossy.progressive,q_65/c_fill,w_1295,h_862/w_80,x_15,y_15,g_south_west,l_Klook_water_br_trans_yhcmh3/activities/t8nrwrrxcnctd4a3m9eb/%E5%B9%BF%E5%B7%9E%E9%95%BF%E9%9A%86%E9%87%8E%E7%94%9F%E5%8A%A8%E7%89%A9%E4%B8%96%E7%95%8C.jpg" alt="A photo of animals at Zoolirante City Zoo" class="section-image">
            </div>
        </article>

        <article class="section section-with-image" id="wildlife-park">
            <h2 class="section-heading">Zoolirante Wildlife Park</h2>
            <div class="image-content-container reverse">
                <div class="text-content">
                    <p>Imagine hand-feeding endangered species like rhinos, having an eye-to-eye encounter with a giraffe, or experiencing the ultimate luxury of arriving via helicopter for a gourmet lunch – all within Australia. This is the adventure that awaits at Zoolirante Wildlife Park!</p>
                    <p>Our vast Australian bushland transforms into authentic habitats for giraffes, lions, hyenas, and even rhinos, roaming alongside native and endangered animals.</p>
                    <p>With over 60% of our species threatened with extinction in the wild, each visit inspires, educates, and directly contributes to our conservation efforts through unique experiences and encounters.</p>
                </div>
                <img src="https://i.pinimg.com/originals/37/30/18/373018440b0da5e11f7ece9bb0fd67ea.jpg" alt="A photo of animals at Zoolirante Wildlife Park" class="section-image">
            </div>
        </article>

        <section class="section" id="animal-welfare">
            <h2 class="section-heading">Animal Welfare: Our Commitment</h2>
            <p>Zoolirante City Zoo and Zoolirante Wildlife Park are proudly accredited by the Zoo and Aquarium Association (ZAA). We are dedicated to upholding the highest standards of animal welfare through a rigorous, science-based approach.</p>
            <p>We deeply care for all our animal residents. Our welfare framework focuses on the Five Domains: Environment, Behaviour, Nutrition, Health, and a Positive Mental State, ensuring every animal receives exceptional care.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="section" id="our-approach">
            <h2 class="section-heading">Our Guiding Principles</h2>
            <p>At the heart of our operations are these core principles:</p>
            <ul class="principles-grid">
                <li><i class="fas fa-heart"></i> Prioritizing ethical animal care and welfare.</li>
                <li><i class="fas fa-flask"></i> Applying a science-based approach to conservation and wildlife management.</li>
                <li><i class="fas fa-users"></i> Engaging communities to grow support for conservation efforts locally and globally.</li>
                <li><i class="fas fa-leaf"></i> Inspiring positive conservation action through enjoyable and inclusive visitor experiences.</li>
                <li><i class="fas fa-sync-alt"></i> Implementing and showcasing sustainable practices in all our operations.</li>
            </ul>
        </section>

       

</body>
</html>